  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (A): Under ASC 830, translation adjustments arising from translating a foreign subsidiary''s financial statements from its functional currency to the reporting currency are reported in other comprehensive income. They accumulate in equity as cumulative translation adjustments (CTA) and are reclassified to earnings upon sale or liquidation.
